# This folder is a self-contained mod project living inside the Ship of
# Harkinian checkout, not game code. The SoH root .gitignore excludes *.o2r
# and *.png globally (they are build outputs for the game itself), but here
# they are the deliverables: the packed archive people drop into mods/, and
# the source textures the archive is built from.
!VersasFate.o2r
!mod_src/textures/**/*.png

# Generated practice audio (tools/preview_lullaby.py) - regenerable, ~900 KB
music/*_preview.wav
music/*_practice.wav
